                                <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="systemBackgroundColor"/>
                                <string key="text">1. General Terms
Users must be at least 18 years old or have parental consent.
By using this service, you agree to comply with all applicable laws and regulations.
We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time.
2. User Responsibilities
Users must provide accurate and up-to-date information.
Any misuse, fraudulent activity, or violation of these terms may result in account suspension.
Users are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of their account credentials.
3. Privacy and Data Protection
Personal data will be collected, stored, and processed in accordance with our Privacy Policy.
We do not share your personal information with third parties without consent, except as required by law.
4. Service Usage
The service is provided "as is" without any guarantees or warranties.
We are not liable for any interruptions, errors, or security breaches.
Users must not attempt to hack, exploit, or distribute malicious software.
5. Intellectual Property
All content, including logos, text, and media, is owned by us or licensed to us.
Unauthorized reproduction, distribution, or modification of our content is prohibited.
6. Payments and Refunds (If applicable)
Payments are processed securely through third-party providers.
Refunds are subject to specific conditions outlined in our Refund Policy.
7. Limitation of Liability
We are not responsible for any direct, indirect, or consequential damages resulting from service usage.
Users agree to use the service at their own risk.
8. Termination of Service
We reserve the right to terminate or suspend accounts for violations of these terms.
Users can request account deletion by contacting support.
9. Dispute Resolution
Any disputes will be resolved through arbitration or as per applicable jurisdictional laws.</string>
